gb9B(){return"We're away, lads. The stands are theirs, but it's eleven against eleven out there."},
gb9C(){return"Nobody here is going to help us. Whatever we take, we take ourselves."},
gb9D(){return"We've come a long way, boys. We didn't come to go home empty-handed."},
gb9E(){return"Everyone sees us as favourites. We'll prove it on the pitch, not on paper."},
gb9F(){return"We're expected to win this one. Doing what's expected is a craft too."},
gb9T(){return"We're up against a strong side today. Nobody gives us a chance. Good, let them think that."},
gb9U(){return"A tough evening awaits us. But big teams lose too, lads."},
